\f1\b \cf0 Developmental Goals\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 1. Develop greater ownership and collaboration skills
\f0\b0 \

\f1\b Goal:
\f0\b0  Build the skills needed to take on increasing responsibility for methodological projects, including coordinating work across teams, communicating with vendors and external partners (contracts?), and contributing to research proposals and project planning.\

\f1\b Success looks like:
\f0\b0  Take increasing ownership of methodological projects; effectively coordinate with stakeholders; contribute to contract drafting and research proposals; and develop the project management, collaboration, and communication skills needed to lead projects more independently.\
\

\f1\b 2. Develop skills in communicating and disseminating methodology to public audiences
\f0\b0 \

\f1\b Goal:
\f0\b0  Dedicate time to writing methodological reports and developing public-facing materials that make methodological findings and advances accessible to broader audiences.\

\f1\b Success looks like:
\f0\b0  Contribute to clear and accessible methods reports and public-facing research products, and develop the ability to translate complex methodological results into materials that are useful and understandable to non-methodological audiences.}